ontent.sh\" --goal-section \"$PLAN_DIR\" 01-button-chain-contract scope -p 5.1: \"Included: initial document subtree, append behavior, terminal completion behavior, and visible white border styling. Excluded: tests, browser execution, external assets, frameworks, storage, network calls, and additional files.\"\n\"$SKILL/scripts/update-plan-content.sh\" --goal-section \"$PLAN_DIR\" 01-button-chain-contract affected -p 6.1: \"Affected future file: button-chain.html. Affected scopes: #button-chain-root, appendNextButton(), finishOnFourthGeneratedButton(), and .completion-message.\"\n\"$SKILL/scripts/update-plan-content.sh\" --goal-section \"$PLAN_DIR\" 01-button-chain-contract dependencies -p 7.1: \"W01 enables W02; W02 enables W03; W03 enables W04. The downstream verification goal consumes W01 through W04 and must not modify them during verification.\"\n\"$SKILL/scripts/update-plan-content.sh\" --goal-section \"$PLAN_DIR\" 01-button-chain-contract approach -p 8.1: \"Use plain HTML, CSS, and JavaScript in button-chain.html. Track generated-button count explicitly, append only when the clicked target is the current last button, and render completion by replacing body content with a single bordered completion element containing exactly finished.\"\n\"$SKILL/scripts/update-plan-content.sh\" --goal-section \"$PLAN_DIR\" 01-button-chain-contract goal-size-exception -p 11.1: \"Not applicable; this goal owns four work units.\"\n# Goal 2\n\"$SKILL/scripts/update-plan-content.sh\" --goal-section \"$PLAN_DIR\" 02-user-story-verification current-state -p 2.1: \"This proof records future browser stories and run caches only. The future executor performs them after button-chain.html exists.\"\n\"$SKILL/scripts/update-plan-content.sh\" --goal-section \"$PLAN_DIR\" 02-user-story-verification why -p 4.1: \"The acceptance criteria are observable UI behavior, so direct click validation is required to prove last-button appending and the terminal completion state.\"\n\"$SKILL/scripts/update-plan-content.sh\" --goal-section \"$PLAN_DIR\" 02-user-story-verification scope -p 5.1: \"Included: US-01 incremental append verification and US-02 fourth-generated completion verification. Excluded: changing implementation during verification, using developer-tool shortcuts, serving through a web server unless the future environment requires it, or accepting screenshots without direct clicks.\"\n\"$SKILL/scripts/update-plan-content.sh\" --goal-section \"$PLAN_DIR\" 02-user-story-verification affected -p 6.1: \"Verification has no implementation file. It affects the browser evidence records in ui-user-stories.md, ui-story-runs/US-01.md, ui-story-runs/US-02.md, and bugs.md when failures are found.\"\n\"$SKILL/scripts/update-plan-content.sh\" --goal-section \"$PLAN_DIR\" 02-user-story-verification dependencies -p 7.1: \"W05 depends on W01 and W02. W06 depends on W01 through W05 so completion is tested only after the append path has produced the required fourth generated button state.\"\n\"$SKILL/scripts/update-plan-content.sh\" --goal-section \"$PLAN_DIR\" 02-user-story-verification approach -p 8.1: \"Run the cached direct-click sequences in order, record pass or bug evidence in the story artifacts, and use the bug register to add investigation and fix goals before retrying any failed required story.\"\n\"$SKILL/scripts/update-plan-content.sh\" --goal-section \"$PLAN_DIR\" 02-user-story-verification goal-size-exception -p 11.1: \"Not applicable; this goal owns two verification work units.\"'","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
