oduced the required fourth generated button state.\"\n\"$SKILL/scripts/update-plan-content.sh\" --goal-section \"$PLAN_DIR\" 02-user-story-verification implementation-approach-risks-and-edge-cases -p 8.1: \"Run the cached direct-click sequences in order, record pass or bug evidence in the story artifacts, and use the bug register to add investigation and fix goals before retrying any failed required story.\"\n\"$SKILL/scripts/update-plan-content.sh\" --goal-section \"$PLAN_DIR\" 02-user-story-verification goal-size-exception -p 11.1: \"Not applicable; this goal owns two verification work units.\"'","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
