ed button as the next last button.\"\nu --step-section \"$PLAN_DIR\" 02-user-story-verification/01-step-verify-append-story acceptance-criteria -p 6.1: \"US-01 passes only if there are exactly four visible buttons after three clicks, each click added exactly one button below the previous last button, and finished is not visible yet.\"\nu --step-section \"$PLAN_DIR\" 02-user-story-verification/01-step-verify-append-story handoff -p 7.1: \"W06 starts from the passing US-01 state with four buttons visible and the fourth generated button as the current last button.\"\nu --step-section \"$PLAN_DIR\" 02-user-story-verification/02-step-verify-finish-story instructions -p 5.1: \"After US-01 passes, execute ui-story-runs/US-02.md exactly by clicking the fourth generated button in the rendered UI. Record browser evidence in ui-user-stories.md and the run cache.\"\nu --step-section \"$PLAN_DIR\" 02-user-story-verification/02-step-verify-finish-story acceptance-criteria -p 6.1: \"US-02 passes only if the click clears the previous buttons and renders only the exact lowercase text finished with a visibly white border. Any mismatch creates a bugs.md entry and follow-up investigation and fix goals.\"\nu --step-section \"$PLAN_DIR\" 02-user-story-verification/02-step-verify-finish-story handoff -p 7.1: \"When W05 and W06 pass with no open bugs, the future implementation satisfies the requested UI behavior.\"'","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
